* CIRCUIT_STUDIO_GF180MCU_FS: exact upstream 3.3V BSIM4 cards.
* Coefficients unchanged; no SAB wrappers, statistical mismatch or signoff.
.param fnoicor=0
.param
 +nmos_3p3_noia='(fnoicor==0)*3.2e+041 + (fnoicor==1)*3.5e+042' 
 +nmos_3p3_noib='(fnoicor==0)*1.2e+020 + (fnoicor==1)*1.2e+020' 
